{
  "duration": 377.19,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "lyric-001-e9ba899e",
      "text": "I am not an AI security researcher.",
      "start": null,
      "end": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-002-202b9f8a",
      "text": "Take my words with a grain of salt.",
      "start": null,
      "end": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-003-54d21a57",
      "text": "It\u2019s June 2026 and I have finally succumbed to the personal agent hype.",
      "start": 0.43,
      "end": 4.87,
      "words": [
        0.43,
        0.95,
        1.144,
        1.406,
        2.056,
        2.483,
        2.693,
        2.84,
        3.09,
        3.573,
        4.056,
        4.196,
        4.333,
        4.61,
        4.87
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-004-c6338ffe",
      "text": "The internet told me to install Hermes, so I did.",
      "start": 5.97,
      "end": 8.25,
      "words": [
        5.97,
        6.07,
        6.31,
        6.59,
        6.71,
        6.85,
        7.07,
        7.51,
        7.91,
        8.05,
        8.25
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-005-ea3d7804",
      "text": "And then they told me to connect it to my email and my Notion, and I did.",
      "start": 8.81,
      "end": 12.07,
      "words": [
        8.81,
        8.97,
        9.11,
        9.25,
        9.41,
        9.53,
        9.61,
        9.85,
        10.03,
        10.13,
        10.25,
        10.55,
        10.69,
        10.81,
        11.25,
        11.69,
        11.81,
        12.07
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-006-f244d0ef",
      "text": "And then they told me that magic would occur, and it did!",
      "start": 12.69,
      "end": 15.73,
      "words": [
        12.69,
        12.87,
        13.03,
        13.17,
        13.37,
        13.51,
        13.65,
        14.01,
        14.23,
        14.51,
        15.15,
        15.29,
        15.73
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-007-565c1660",
      "text": "Just like that, I had a personal assistant that could clean my junk mail, find me restaurant reservations, and even summarize 52 episodes of the Ryan Peterman podcast.",
      "start": 16.79,
      "end": 25.35,
      "words": [
        16.79,
        17.17,
        17.41,
        17.63,
        18.01,
        18.15,
        18.23,
        18.57,
        18.99,
        19.25,
        19.37,
        19.63,
        19.75,
        19.99,
        20.23,
        20.81,
        20.99,
        21.25,
        21.71,
        22.21,
        22.59,
        23.09,
        23.49,
        23.91,
        24.19,
        24.29,
        24.49,
        24.85,
        25.35
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-008-2b7a6a9e",
      "text": "The thought of cybersecurity lurked somewhere in the back of my head, but it took a friend convincing my agent to forward them my email inbox for me to realize that the problem was much deeper than a few security tokens.",
      "start": 26.11,
      "end": 35.69,
      "words": [
        26.11,
        26.51,
        26.69,
        26.81,
        27.23,
        27.73,
        28.09,
        28.25,
        28.33,
        28.51,
        28.61,
        28.75,
        28.99,
        29.39,
        29.51,
        29.61,
        29.75,
        30.01,
        30.41,
        30.63,
        30.87,
        31.05,
        31.29,
        31.49,
        31.63,
        31.87,
        32.21,
        32.45,
        32.59,
        32.75,
        33.01,
        33.29,
        33.41,
        33.79,
        34.01,
        34.27,
        34.57,
        34.77,
        34.89,
        34.99,
        35.37,
        35.69
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-009-694685b5",
      "text": "What is Private Information?",
      "start": null,
      "end": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-010-5122c08f",
      "text": "My first feeling was one of disappointment that the agent thought it was okay to share my inbox to someone else, but then I realized that is exactly what millions of people do to track their packages.",
      "start": 36.87,
      "end": 46.09,
      "words": [
        36.87,
        37.29,
        37.49,
        37.79,
        37.95,
        38.13,
        38.23,
        38.63,
        39.23,
        39.37,
        39.59,
        39.91,
        40.11,
        40.21,
        40.51,
        40.63,
        40.85,
        40.97,
        41.25,
        41.45,
        41.69,
        41.99,
        42.75,
        42.89,
        43.01,
