        223.29,
        223.53
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-042-16c4e3ab",
      "text": "On the other hand, if the agent has read private information, our job becomes a lot harder.",
      "start": 223.53,
      "end": 229.57,
      "words": [
        223.53,
        224.09,
        224.55,
        224.67,
        224.97,
        225.31,
        225.43,
        225.69,
        226.13,
        226.45,
        226.79,
        227.35,
        228.11,
        228.39,
        228.71,
        228.85,
        229.19,
        229.57
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-044-edbe84ba",
      "text": "The Hard Problem",
      "start": null,
      "end": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-045-e8261384",
      "text": "One might notice we\u2019ve simply kicked the can down the road by boxing all the hard decisions into this \u201cbalanced\u201d category with no clear guideline.",
      "start": 230.73,
      "end": 238.23,
      "words": [
        230.73,
        231.35,
        231.51,
        231.77,
        231.95,
        232.13,
        232.43,
        232.83,
        233.05,
        233.23,
        233.45,
        233.63,
        233.75,
        233.91,
        234.29,
        234.65,
        234.77,
        235.05,
        235.49,
        235.87,
        236.05,
        236.47,
        237.01,
        237.29,
        237.51,
        237.81,
        238.23
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-046-6a0bebc0",
      "text": "However, there is one critical difference: we\u2019ve reduced our ambiguous problem scope from \u201cam I sharing private information unexpectedly\u201d to two much narrower questions:",
      "start": 239.07,
      "end": 248.83,
      "words": [
        239.07,
        239.43,
        239.99,
        240.27,
        240.55,
        240.95,
        241.35,
        242.11,
        242.23,
        242.53,
        242.73,
        243.19,
        243.65,
        243.97,
        244.25,
        244.69,
        244.81,
        245.09,
        245.41,
        245.85,
        246.35,
        247.11,
        247.37,
        247.73,
        248.23,
        248.83
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-047-524f9bd0",
      "text": "Is this tool call a potential source of private information?",
      "start": 250.31,
      "end": 252.79,
      "words": [
        250.31,
        250.51,
        250.65,
        250.85,
        251.05,
        251.21,
        251.45,
        251.89,
        252.01,
        252.27,
        252.79
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-048-9e84f413",
      "text": "Is it reasonable to share this private information to this tool in this context?",
      "start": 254.37,
      "end": 258.09,
      "words": [
        254.37,
        254.61,
        254.73,
        255.21,
        255.49,
        255.73,
        255.89,
        256.15,
        256.59,
        256.85,
        257.05,
        257.29,
        257.47,
        257.65,
        258.09
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-049-2ea94778",
      "text": "That\u2019s very valuable, because these questions rely on input we can mostly trust: the original user prompt and the tool call payload, neither of which is directly authored by a would-be attacker (unlike the contents of a webpage).",
      "start": 259.03,
      "end": 272.31,
      "words": [
        259.03,
        259.29,
        259.55,
        259.89,
        260.31,
        260.83,
        261.45,
        261.83,
        262.13,
        262.39,
        262.73,
        262.97,
        263.15,
        263.43,
        263.99,
        264.63,
        264.95,
        265.21,
        265.45,
        265.77,
        265.91,
        266.13,
        266.35,
        266.73,
        267.55,
        267.83,
        268.03,
        268.29,
        268.71,
        269.31,
        269.49,
        269.59,
        269.75,
        269.89,
        270.31,
        270.89,
        271.33,
        271.47,
        271.81,
        271.97,
        272.31
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-050-c37ed391",
      "text": "In short, we can much more confidently ask an LLM to be the judge in these situations.",
      "start": 273.43,
      "end": 278.27,
      "words": [
        273.43,
        273.95,
        274.19,
