        310.32,
        310.46,
        310.94,
        311.32,
        311.66,
        311.8,
        312.02,
        312.18,
        312.32
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-061-2255ce5c",
      "text": "Taints: broad classifications so the judge knows it\u2019s dealing with \u201cemail\u201d or \u201ccalendar\u201d information as opposed to any \u201cprivate\u201d information",
